I don't have a 128GB MacBook to run ds4 out of, but I resonate with all the points on Armin's post. He was telling me, @mervenoyann, and @cristinaponcela that local models need more polish a month ago in London. Today, I am happy to be given a chance and a shot at the problem.

@mitsuhiko: "I think @antirez ds4.c is important! I wrote down my thoughts on why I built pi-ds4 and why we need to focus our local model efforts stronger than we do currently."

The linked article discusses the importance of focusing on improving local models through better polish and effort.

